-- 2026-11-19: Veronica on SoFlo 114, and the doctor-tip clip series (playbook ve-podcast-studio). Safe to run twice.
insert into playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind, created_at)
select 've-podcast-studio', 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', $b$Sean 2026-11-19: Veronica's Spotlight is on the SoFlo Vegans Podcast, the next one (Episode 114, Wed Nov 25), not Vegans Explore Ep 148; reel v4 says "The SoFlo Vegans Podcast · Episode 114, now live." NEXT (Sean): "look at who we featured in the last couple of episodes and see if we can't do another clip... pull their video and do the same exact thing... a lot of nice little clips that promote our podcast but also share valuable information, and then strategically lock those into each episode. So a lot of doctor's tips... even just on that one podcast with Dr. Michael [Klaper]. We can clip each one to be, here's what we got to say about B12... content that we can sprinkle in throughout the week, because his content usually does pretty well. Probably our top video on YouTube." Candidates in the content index: Dr. Michael Klaper Ep 59 (B12 from soil microbes 37:05, B12 dose 39:57, Vegan B12 labels 41:23, iodine 43:42, vitamin D 45:37, protein 56:01, batch cooking 49:14, fruit for dessert 25:39), Dr. Neal Barnard Ep 44 (cheese is addictive 3:39, diabetes is fat not sugar 6:03, eggs 20:32, soy myth 14:37, B12 8:25). Needs: the Ep 59 and Ep 44 videos in Drive; a doctor-tip variant of the reel frame (no city: a topic frame), mocked before cutting.$b$, 'text', 'decision', now()
where not exists (select 1 from playbook_records where slug='ve-podcast-studio' and body like 'Sean 2026-11-19: Veronica''s Spotlight is on the SoFlo%');
